<#f0f000>Movelist :</>


<#f0f000>Information :</>
Itsuwa is a sort of install and shoto character
She has a sigil system that has both
passive and active effects on her gameplan.

<#00ff77>About Sigils :</>

Itsuwa can have one sigil at a time.
You have passives when a sigil is active.
You consume a sigil on sigil specials
and throw the active ability

There are 5 kinds of sigils:
<#ff0000>_`Ryousen (Fire)</>
Passively increases speed and gives airdash(es)
Actively creates an overhead fire attack on sigil specials
<#0000ff>_`Hasen (Water)</>
Passively increases defense
Actively creates a low water attack on sigil specials
<#00ff00>_`Chisen (Earth)</>
Passively increases attack
Actively increases the attack further on sigil specials
Earthquake on super sigil variant for supers
<#ffff00>_`Kuusen (Atmosphere)</>
Passively increases air mobility and gives air jump(s)
Actively creates air projectile(s) on sigil specials
_`Zensen (All-around)
Passively combines all the passives
Actively launches all the actives

The logic of sigil specials is in general :
special a : fast and mixes up upon consumption of sigil
special b : slow and gives sigil
<#00ff00>Lvl-1</>
special c : fast and gives super sigil

All versions consume sigils

While not being the only way she can fight,
this system is central to her kit

