About Dodges :
You can dodge in 3 manners :
_`When you have control of itsuwa
_`After obtaining a sigil (<#0000ff>Hasen</>, <#ff0000>Ryousen</>)
_`After attacking (<#00ff00>Chisen</>, <#ffff00>Kuusen</>)

For the latter 2, it only concerns the b version
of the sigil moves


Charge up								^LK_+^HK / ^A_+^C

