About Magic combination :
There is a "deadly rave" system, that changes the sigil
during the move.
A successful input is shown with a pentagram.
The order of sigils obtained is:
<#00ff00>Earth</> -> <#0000ff>Water</> -> <#ff0000>Fire</> -> <#ffff00>Atmosphere</>.
The input windows are when Itsuwa is readying up her hit.
The inputs are the following:
<#00ff00>Earth</>							_D_DF_F^HK / _D_DF_F^C
<#0000ff>Water</>							_D_DF_F^HK / _D_DF_F^C
<#ff0000>Fire</>							_D_DB_B^HK / _D_DB_B^C
<#ffff00>Atmosphere</>							_F_D_DF^HK / _F_D_DF^C
The last sigil obtained will be the one kept at the end
of the move.

About Saint Destroyer :
You obtain Zensen automatically while performing
Saint Destroyer.
If you've inputed every input of the deadly rave
successfully you get:
_`super sigil version of Zensen
_`pseudo magic name state
If your opponent is a Saint, the Saint Destroyer
does more damage (with an extended animation).

